## Flowchart

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([START]) --> B[Initialize head and tail as NULL]
    B --> C[/Display Menu and Enter Choice/]
    C --> D{Select Choice}

    D -->|1 Add Order| E[/Enter Order Details/]
    E --> F[Create New Node]
    F --> G{Is List Empty?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Set head and tail to New Node]
    G -->|No| I[Link New Node after tail]
    I --> J[Update tail]
    H --> C
    J --> C

    D -->|2 Display Forward| K{Is head NULL?}
    K -->|Yes| L[/Display No Orders Available/]
    K -->|No| M[Set temp = head]
    M --> N[/Display Order Details/]
    N --> O[Move temp to next Node]
    O --> P{Is temp NULL?}
    P -->|No| N
    P -->|Yes| C
    L --> C

    D -->|3 Display Reverse| Q{Is tail NULL?}
    Q -->|Yes| R[/Display No Orders Available/]
    Q -->|No| S[Set temp = tail]
    S --> T[/Display Order Details/]
    T --> U[Move temp to previous Node]
    U --> V{Is temp NULL?}
    V -->|No| T
    V -->|Yes| C
    R --> C

    D -->|4 Complete Order| W{Is head NULL?}
    W -->|Yes| X[/Display No Orders to Complete/]
    W -->|No| Y[Store head in temp]
    Y --> Z[Move head to next Node]
    Z --> AA{Is head NULL?}
    AA -->|Yes| AB[Set tail = NULL]
    AA -->|No| AC[Set head prev = NULL]
    AB --> AD[Delete temp]
    AC --> AD
    AD --> C
    X --> C

    D -->|5 Exit| AE[Free Allocated Memory]
    AE --> AF([STOP])

    D -->|Invalid Choice| AG[/Display Invalid Choice/]
    AG --> C
```
